  "synopsis": "Spacious apartment in a new building, an expansive kitchen with an induction stove, a bathroom with a separated toilet, and even a washroom, all for just... 4,800 yen a month?! But there is a spooky reason Maison Shiba is so doggone affordable.\n\nThe room high schooler Koori Momose was offered came with a roommate: Muu-chan, a shiba inu who happens to be an earthbound spirit. With the ultimate goal of a comfortable lifestyle with no roommates, Koori tries all kinds of strategies to unbind Muu from Room 101.\n\n(Source: Official Site)",
